* End-of-turn {{2|Orb}} passives now trigger before {{BD2|Doom}}
** This means that, if a player would die to self-{{BD2|Doom}} (ex. from Neurosurge card) but also has an Orb with an end-of-turn passive that would kill the last remaining enemy (ex. Lightning Orb while the enemy is at 3 HP), they will now win the combat instead of losing it after ending their turn

